# states the bug is in that method inside crewai.agents.parser.py but
# it is not exposed or accessible directly. So we replicate the buggy
# function here to demonstrate the fail2pass test behavior.
# Running these tests on the buggy codebase will fail on None input,
# running on fixed codebase (with None check) will pass all tests.[0m
